    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror where reality and fantasy cross each other, where survival itself is the goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, who is heading home from work, faces a collapsed world as unidentified monsters emerge in the middle of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player begins his journey to survival in search of his son, who is unknown where he may be, in the city in chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the ruins of the city, gathering resources, fighting monsters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a third-person survival horror action adventure with more than just horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features of the Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. An immersive world that navigates through darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore various places such as blacked-out marts, abandoned underground parking lots, and ruined buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to navigate their environment and find their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/cf927aba0896052573840f8b3474f8b1.poster.avif?t=1752463400\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/cf927aba0896052573840f8b3474f8b1.webm?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/cf927aba0896052573840f8b3474f8b1.mp4?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Intuitive item interaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore essential resources such as weapons, recovery items, keys, and others directly and acquire them through interaction keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add immersion with simple animation and effects when using items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/53c533b12b174a19bc1f7834daca591b.poster.avif?t=1752463400\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/53c533b12b174a19bc1f7834daca591b.webm?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/53c533b12b174a19bc1f7834daca591b.mp4?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Strategic Combat and Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have to fight monsters using different weapons such as pistols, pipes, knives, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition is limited and strategic choice dictates survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a thrilling combat system that crosses close-up/distance battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/3cf7f335f03a5b6ff4ca6cc3851b1339.poster.avif?t=1752463400\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/3cf7f335f03a5b6ff4ca6cc3851b1339.webm?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Horror with enhanced graphics and sound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing the latest graphics technology, we maximize the atmosphere of the ruined city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The suspense and fear-producing soundscape provides immersive experience as if you were in a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Over the Shoulder Camera View</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It adopts a third-person over the shoulder camera viewpoint that follows the character behind his back, realizing a tense close-up battle with the enemy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror where reality and fantasy cross each other, where survival itself is the goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, who is heading home from work, faces a collapsed world as unidentified monsters emerge in the middle of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player begins his journey to survival in search of his son, who is unknown where he may be, in the city in chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the ruins of the city, gathering resources, fighting monsters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a third-person survival horror action adventure with more than just horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features of the Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. An immersive world that navigates through darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore various places such as blacked-out marts, abandoned underground parking lots, and ruined buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to navigate their environment and find their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/cf927aba0896052573840f8b3474f8b1.poster.avif?t=1752463400\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/cf927aba0896052573840f8b3474f8b1.webm?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/cf927aba0896052573840f8b3474f8b1.mp4?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Intuitive item interaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore essential resources such as weapons, recovery items, keys, and others directly and acquire them through interaction keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add immersion with simple animation and effects when using items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/53c533b12b174a19bc1f7834daca591b.poster.avif?t=1752463400\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/53c533b12b174a19bc1f7834daca591b.webm?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/53c533b12b174a19bc1f7834daca591b.mp4?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Strategic Combat and Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have to fight monsters using different weapons such as pistols, pipes, knives, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition is limited and strategic choice dictates survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a thrilling combat system that crosses close-up/distance battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/3cf7f335f03a5b6ff4ca6cc3851b1339.poster.avif?t=1752463400\" width=720 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473710/extras/3cf7f335f03a5b6ff4ca6cc3851b1339.webm?t=1752463400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Horror with enhanced graphics and sound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing the latest graphics technology, we maximize the atmosphere of the ruined city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The suspense and fear-producing soundscape provides immersive experience as if you were in a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Over the Shoulder Camera View</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It adopts a third-person over the shoulder camera viewpoint that follows the character behind his back, realizing a tense close-up battle with the enemy.</p>",
